---
/** Institutional Memory: one question asked of every filing, report and note the firm holds. */
---
<div class="mem" data-ui role="img" aria-label="Institutional Memory: a question about exports answered with citations from four documents">
  <div class="ask">What did Deccan Auto say about export orders since FY25?</div>
  <p class="ans">
    Management guided export revenue to 22% of sales by FY27, up from 14%, citing two new
    European OEM programmes. The plant visit on 12 Sep found the second line at 60% use.
  </p>
  <ul class="src">
    <li><span>Concall Q1 FY27</span><span>p. 4</span></li>
    <li><span>Plant visit · S. Mehta</span><span>12 Sep</span></li>
    <li><span>Sell-side initiation</span><span>p. 11</span></li>
    <li><span>Annual report FY26</span><span>p. 54</span></li>
  </ul>
</div>
<style>
  .mem { color: var(--ink); padding: 18px; display: grid; gap: 14px; font-size: 13px; align-content: start; height: 100%; }
  .ask { background: var(--ground); border: 1px solid var(--ground-4); border-radius: 12px; padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 14px; } /* taste-skill-ignore: data-ui input */
  .ans { font-family: var(--text); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--ink); }
  .src { display: grid; gap: 4px; }
  .src li { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 8px; background: var(--ground-2); }
  .src li span:last-child { color: var(--ink-soft); }
</style>
